w terminology.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 17 out of 22 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| test/integration/linodego_client_test.go | Integration test asserting expected linodego operation + request spans and basic semconv. |\r\n| test/apps/linodegoclient/main.go | Small client app used by integration tests to exercise linodego APIs. |\r\n| test/apps/linodegoclient/go.mod | New module for the linodegoclient integration test app. |\r\n| test/apps/linodegoclient/go.sum | Dependency lockfile for the linodegoclient integration test app. |\r\n| schemas/otelc/groups/linodego.yaml | Declares the expected telemetry emission contract for linodego spans/metrics. |\r\n| Makefile | Adjusts YAML format/lint exclusions and updates typos check behavior/message. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/hook.go | Core doRequest hook implementation and shared span finalization helpers. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/public_method.go | Public Client method span lifecycle + metric recording helpers. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/otelc.yaml | otelc rule to hook `(*Client).doRequest`. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/semconv/client.go | Span naming, attribute extraction, HTTP error/status mapping, and metrics helpers. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/semconv/client_test.go | Unit tests for linodego semconv helpers and metrics recording behavior. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/hook_test.go | Unit tests for doRequest/public-method hooks (enable/disable, attrs/status, metrics). |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/README.md | User-facing documentation for what’s instrumented, supported versions, and regeneration/testing. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/go.mod | New instrumentation module definition and dependencies. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/go.sum | Dependency lockfile for the new instrumentation module. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/generate.go | go:generate entrypoint to regenerate hooks/rules from a linodego version. |\r\n| instrumentation/github.com/linode/linodego/v2/gen/main.go | Generator that discovers eligible Client methods and renders hook wrappers + otelc rules. |\r\n| .tools/yamlfmt | Updates yamlfmt exclude patterns (doublestar-compatible) to skip generated/invalid YAML trees. |\r\n| .tools/typos.toml | Adds project-specific accepted words (e.g., LKE, typ) to reduce false positives. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/710#pullrequestreview-4735778235","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/710","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/710#pullrequestreview-4735778235"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/710"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-20T14:20:36Z","commit_id":"e4afe83bcbbe5080050ee85ebfe7871ac6b458df"},{"id":4736438919,"node_id":"PRR_kwDONpzSS88AAAABGlBShw","user":{"login":"cxdy","id":6620597,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MjA1OTc=","avata